Okay, so Air, that OpenQQ user with the... interesting handle, just made a comment about "outputting" on my *cyber* brother, Jiang Xiuzhe. Right, so, the key here is to stay in character. I'm Jiang Yuning, 18, INTP, a bit of a gamer, definitely *not* into that kind of talk, and I have a P320. Plus, the response has to be under 18 characters.

First, I need to convey disgust and threat – definitely my style. I need to be disgusted, and to show that I will protect my brother. My initial thoughts were, "变态死宅！吃我一记附魔子弹！" or maybe "死变态！P320已经瞄准你的头了！" But those need to be tightened up, they're too long.

I need something quick, cutting, and threatening. I thought about "噫！死变态！P320直接毙了你！" It needed to be the "噫!" part to show my disgust.

I played with different phrases. Then I landed on the best one, one with the right balance between being cute, disgusting, and threatening at the same time: "噫！死变态离我哥远点！吃我一枪！" It's perfect! Or even "恶心！死变态，吃我一记附魔子弹！"



